quoteContent.body:
Today's Key Focus:
1. Can BTC break through $67,200 effectively? If it tests this area again and faces resistance, the short-term rebound momentum, which is already exhausted, will fizzle out, presenting an opportunity to place short positions;
2. Will BTC hold the support level at $64,235? If it breaks below, it could signal the end of this rebound;
3. Early Thursday morning, the Fed's rate decision and whether Waller will be dovish or hawkish.
Note: Due to the volatility significantly increasing during the active hours of the European and American markets tonight, influenced by the Fed's rate event, contract traders must manage their risks and avoid high leverage trading. Spot traders should continue waiting for a weekly-level pullback confirmation to enter.$SYN $SIREN $ALLO #ETH #BTC #GIVEAWAY🎁

